 trial or subscription ends, access may be locked while information remains stored for a reasonable period. Information may later be deleted, de-identified or retained where lawful and necessary. A Business may contact us about account closure or data requests."
+    "text": "For ordinary CutFlow bookings, identifying customer details are temporary. After the final active service is marked completed, CutFlow removes the completed appointment's customer link and notes and de-identifies the customer profile by clearing name, phone, email, birthday, preferences and marketing status. Walk-ins are not added to the permanent customer list, and their name, phone and notes are cleared when service is completed. Anonymous operational records may remain for reporting, payment, accounting and service statistics."
+  },
