+    "type": "p",
+    "text": "If the same customer still has another active booking or queue entry, CutFlow may retain the identifying details only until that active service relationship is completed. When a trial or subscription ends, business-account information may remain stored for a reasonable period where lawful and necessary. A Business may contact us about account closure or data requests."
